{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And they said: Come, let us build us a city.</b> This was the counsel of the leaders of that generation, to enthrone Nimrod over the entire human species." "<b>And a tower whose head is in the heavens, and let us make us a name.</b> Let us make us a name — an idolatrous cult that would be in the tower, so that its height and the greatness of its city would become renowned among the entire human species, such that it would be considered the elohim of elohim among all humankind, and all would inquire of it. The intent in this was that the king of that city would rule over the entire human species, since there would be the focus of inquiry for all."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:29:47.714774526Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}